    "description": "### Impact\nPrevent the disclosure of private chat thread messages through the onebox endpoint by scoping thread lookups to the authorized chat channel. This ensures that users cannot access private thread content by pairing a public channel ID with a private thread ID in a onebox request.\n\n### Patches\nUpgrade to the patched version.\n\n### Workarounds\nUpgrade to the patched version.",
